<title>ITALY: Bonos end down but off lows, focus on March CPI.</title>
<headline>Bonos end down but off lows, focus on March CPI.</headline>
<text>
<p>1515 GMT - Bonos end down on Thursday but off lows, tracking Italian market. All eyes now on March CPI due on Friday. * 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 103.10 vs 103.53, yield 6.91 vs 6.89 * June bond future 112.99 vs 113.50 at Wednesday's close * Peseta/mark 84.41/44 vs 84.40/41</p>
</text>
